  "name": "Quick Egg Roll Dipping Sauce",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This egg roll sauce is an easy 5-minute dipping sauce recipe that tastes better than boxed sauce packets and is made with simple Asian ingredients.",
